{"id":249511102701788,"type":"artist","name":"KMFDM","artist":null,"year":1984,"weight":47,"info":{"tags":["industrial","industrial rock","industrial metal","electronic","german"],"country":"DE","begin":"1984-02-29","kind":"Group","similar":["MDFMK","Chemlab","Pig","Slick Idiot","Genitorturers","My Life with the Thrill Kill Kult","Sister Machine Gun","Miss Construction","SKOLD vs. KMFDM","Revolting Cocks"],"img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Kmfdm_live_in_2011.jpg?width=500","bio":"Su Significado en alemán es “Kein Mitleid Für Die Mehrheit” lo que significa exactamente \"Ninguna Piedad para con la Mayoría (de la población, se entiende)\". Aunque también los fans dicen que quiere decir “Kill Mother Fucker Depeche Mode” aunque nada tiene que ver con eso.\n\nKMFDM es una banda de música electrónica, del género industrial, ellos definen su estilo como Ultra Heavy Beat. Fue fundada París en 1984 por Sascha Konietzko y el pintor alemán Udo Sturm."},"works":[{"id":116548195064561,"type":"album","name":"Opium","artist":"KMFDM","year":1984,"weight":3,"yt":"3_6JDQCZms4","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":235879004384475,"name":"RYM Top — Electronic — Electro-Industrial","rank":191,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":1}},{"id":56045184465986,"type":"album","name":"What Do You Know Deutschland","artist":"KMFDM","year":1986,"weight":6,"yt":"b0tCv7sNcF4","src":"books","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[],"n_lists":0}},{"id":204594879857940,"type":"album","name":"Naive","artist":"KMFDM","year":1990,"weight":15,"yt":"8Dzs4TS_rKc","src":"books,charts,musthear","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":90391435651867,"name":"Sputnikmusic Best Albums 1990","rank":182,"scaruffi":7.0},{"id":13018320481353,"name":"Scaruffi 1990s","rank":838,"scaruffi":7.0},{"id":22489675167